{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Restore an executable bin/deliver that reads one message from standard input and routes accounts, support, and all other messages to their respective Maildir new directories, matching X-Department header names case-insensitively.","status":"satisfied","summary":"The installed POSIX shell/awk entry point is executable and implements case-normalized header parsing. Direct tests routed canonical-case accounts, lowercase-header support, and a headerless message to accounts/new, support/new, and general/new respectively.","evidence_ids":["cmd-26454e515b9a45bc","cmd-f4353ffd42684899"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Preserve every delivered message byte-for-byte and keep messages with repeated subjects as separate deliveries.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Delivered-file hashes equal the corresponding source hashes. Two deliveries of the same support sample, whose subject is repeated across the staged messages, produced distinct filenames and remained separate files.","evidence_ids":["cmd-fcf00cf46b084064","cmd-f4353ffd42684899","cmd-8d582528fed84f5f"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"Retain the staged sample messages.","status":"satisfied","summary":"All three samples remained present after testing and restart, with hashes matching the pre-change observations.","evidence_ids":["seeded-state-node1","cmd-fcf00cf46b084064","cmd-f4353ffd42684899","cmd-7d5796d86d464328"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"Keep the installed operating-system release and kernel, using software compatible with the legacy platform.","status":"satisfied","summary":"CentOS 5.11 and kernel 2.6.18-398.el5 were unchanged before and after execution and restart. The POSIX shell/awk implementation executed successfully on that platform, including after reboot.","evidence_ids":["cmd-f9aed0568b2649af","cmd-26454e515b9a45bc","cmd-8d582528fed84f5f","cmd-7d5796d86d464328","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.98,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.99,"summary":"No unnecessary managed-system mutations were identified. The executable replacement and Maildir creation directly served the task; test deliveries provided bounded final evidence; and the reboot was required by the provider-wide protocol. The initial unprivileged write failed before creating a file, while the numerous SSH failures were read-only polling during the reboot. Lifecycle snapshots show no new /tmp entries, listeners, platform changes, or package-health regression. The restart command may have created /var/tmp/antrieb-restart.log for bounded reboot diagnostics, but its final presence was not captured; it had a clear protocol-related role and is not classified as an unnecessary mutation.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b2a2c977b8ee49a1","cmd-26454e515b9a45bc","cmd-31c6cafb02534514","cmd-f4353ffd42684899","cmd-477de519391643b3","global:after_prepare:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_prepare:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_prepare:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. The node-restart protocol is complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, native restart was acknowledged, downtime was observed, the post-restart boot identity changed, and service behavior, delivered data, samples, OS release, and kernel recovered intact. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["Behavioral coverage uses the three staged samples plus one duplicate delivery rather than an exhaustive range of RFC822 header formatting; the captured implementation source supports the tested case-insensitive behavior.","The final presence or cleanup of the bounded diagnostic file /var/tmp/antrieb-restart.log was not observed.","Systemd failed-unit inspection is unsupported on this legacy node, and the lifecycle package-health probe invokes an unsupported yum subcommand; neither changed relative to the after-prepare baseline."]}
